h(1, 1200, """A tribe in Iraq shed a girl's blood, then celebrated collectively! A day is coming, not far off, when mustaches will be trampled""")

h(1, 2200, """You know the bad times when you see people brawling every day and everywhere like roosters!""")

t(2, 440, """For a century, many billions have been pumped into sub-Saharan Africa, and the result is more abject poverty, because the sub-Saharan states treated money as a tool of domination and control, while mature states used money as a tool of development. So development is never in merely possessing money; money alone does not create development. What matters is that the leader possesses, along with money, the plan, the idea, the model, depth in reading reality, foresight about the future, accounting institutions, regulatory government bodies of real quality in performance, and a transparent oversight apparatus.""")

h(2, 1100, """In human life, money is either power only or for development. Pharaoh and Qarun used it as power only! The Prophet and his caliphs used it for development""")

t(2, 1830, """Where is the resolve, where is the chivalry, where is the vigor that must remain until the last moment of life? Know, O fathers living this feebleness, that you will reach it, but when you reach it you will discover the extent of the harm you have done to yourselves, because in today's world your children can barely spend on themselves, and few of them have enough means to be able to help their kin.

Be strong like the Companions, who lived and died needing no one! Whoever holds himself cheap will come to disgrace .. Take care of your health and do not spend it on a son or on a daughter. Give your children what is possible and the obligation set out in your Lord's Book, and beware of sacrificing for them at the expense of your health, your personal life and your happiness. Beware, and again beware, a thousand thousand times!

Nothing benefits you but Allah, so take the means of staying healthy, and do not waste your health and say "tomorrow our children will carry us around the house!" No one will carry you, you naive ones! Do not live as a burden on any creature. Why do you want such a miserable, bad life?! So that you eat whatever you like? In exchange for food, love of comfort and lying sprawled on beds, you bring feebleness to your bones, your bodies and your health, and live as exhausted invalids waiting for a precious moment of care from your children, who may come once a year, while they live in one of the worst and most evil of ages?! Follow the Companions, whose minds were not miserable like the many miserable minds of today. Be young until death, and enough of choosing options that were never found in the masters of old, but only in their common folk.. Live the life of masters and think with the minds of masters.""")

h(3, 400, """Strange fathers; by Allah I do not understand, and I never will! Have you seen al-Siddiq, al-Faruq, Uthman, Abu al-Hasanayn and Khalid saying "we raise our children so they will carry us in our old age"?!!""")

t(3, 1100, """Only a very few children escape this black fate""")

h(3, 1500, """Quarreling spouses raise children shaken from within, trembling before the world and people!""")

h(4, 300, """How long will this ignorance last? A noble, chosen Prophet, and "Muslims" attach his name to one of the vilest acts!""")

t(4, 820, """Millions of Muslim fathers and mothers are drowning .. drowning in mountains of sins on the Day of Resurrection .. mighty mountains!""")

h(4, 1300, """Sifting the catastrophic, hideous collective thinking! A year and a half ago I told a mother: "You have no right to backbite your children," and she was astonished!!""")

t(4, 1990, """Nations live well when they are as alert to the inside as they are to the outside! And a person lives well when alert to his own self, because it is his inner enemy. A person becomes upright in word and deed when he is alert to collective thinking, because it is in constant need of sifting!""")

h(4, 2400, """A person wakes up when struck suddenly in his heart, liver or pancreas, but he does not wake up when struck suddenly in his skin, his hair and his fingers!""")

t(5, 690, """I said it in 2011 when the revolutions of the Hebrew Spring flared up .. but alas.. The decree of Allah Most High is above everything, always and forever.""")

h(5, 1200, """A thousand thousand voices do not support a single oppressed person, yet one lofty word supports all the oppressed!""")

h(5, 2200, """The oppressor does not see his oppression until he sees Allah's victory for the one he oppressed!""")

t(6, 320, """In the courts and before the judges, all criminals confess!""")

h(6, 800, """The oppressor does not see his oppression until a lofty, crushing force compels him to look!""")

h(6, 1900, """An oppressive soul does not desist until it sees from society complete submission to the truth!""")

h(7, 500, """People do not accept just rulings until they learn the consequences of their committing oppression!""")

h(7, 1600, """Whoever is tried with judging between people must have a thousand minds, a thousand understandings and a thousand insights!""")

t(7, 2455, """To the women who say 24 hours a day: "I sacrificed my life with him and wasted my youth caring for his children!" and to the men who say 24 hours a day: "I wasted my youth spending on my children!" Enough inversion of human nature! You married and gave birth to care for your children, not his children alone! This is your role, not at your whim, and there is no such thing as "you wasted your life caring for his children," as if he brought his children from the sidewalk and told you "care for them," or as if they were his children from another woman and he told you "care for them"! All this talk is now spreading on social media, and these women believe themselves! And fathers appearing in clips: "I wasted my youth spending on my children!" Glory be to Allah. Who was going to spend on them?! Society? Are you not the one who …""")

t(8, 60, """… fathered them? Or did you wake up one morning and find them in your house, come down from the sky? People's minds have become crooked, and only a few sane people remain in this world. Social media has shown us where the world stands today, and what limit we have reached on the scale of people's deviant, unhealthy understanding of life and its realities. Every woman who falls out with her husband: "The oppressor wasted my youth while I cared for his children!" His children alone? And what, then, is your role in life other than that?!""")

h(8, 600, """A mother's care for her children is an obligation, not at her whim. A father's spending on his children is an obligation, not at his whim!""")

t(8, 1370, """He was sent down to earth to fight, so he cared only for his daily sustenance, though the whole earth was his alone; yet he remained concerned only with his daily sustenance. Know, O human, that the warrior cannot be wealthy! The warrior cannot be greedy for wealth .. it is the keys to laying down arms! There is no wealth in human history that did not leave its dust and trace on the souls of even the most pious of the pious!""")

h(8, 1900, """Our father Adam was sent down to earth to fight, so do not tell me "live to own the world," for I will respond only to my father's legacy!""")

h(9, 400, """Our father Adam was sent down to earth to fight. Know that the moment you lay down your weapon in facing Satan is the moment you abandon your father's legacy!""")

t(9, 1195, """In an imagined scene! He finds no answer to give but this! He says nothing but this!""")

h(9, 1600, """On the Day of Resurrection the misguided and the lost one is asked: "Where is the trust?" He says: "I perished over a hundred thousand dollars, 20 children, 3 villas, five cars and 10 orchards!" """)

h(10, 300, """The world of 1945 convinced you of 10000 illusory achievements in life! And hid from you every meaning of real achievements!""")

h(10, 1300, """The oppressor reads words of wisdom and says: "Fancy talk! Ha! Ha! .. What is this one saying?! I don't understand!" """)

t(10, 2005, """They took part in the sin and in its muddle, but they do not admit it!""")

h(10, 2300, """Did you know that millions of the oppressed are in fact oppressors?!""")

h(11, 1000, """The oppressors read the Qur'an, and are asked: "What have you understood?" They say: "Huh? Huh? What do you mean? Understood? Understood what?!" """)

h(11, 2100, """Do not settle for building your body. The soul carries loads a thousand thousand times more important than the weight of heavy iron!""")

h(12, 700, """A fine hair of wisdom separates resisting a defiant one from wronging a defiant one!""")

t(12, 1410, """Specifically "those who rub themselves against religion"; they are the enemy before the sinners, and their danger is no less than the danger of the sinners, because the people of sin are not hidden from people.""")

h(12, 1900, """Exposing the corrupt morals of a speaking personality who misleads people is not oppression!""")

t(13, 65, """Resisting a general oppression by speaking to people is stirring up strife in society! And in resisting personal and social oppression, there is a fine line between resisting personal oppression within the family, the clan and the narrow social circle, and launching immoral raids and counting them as resistance to oppression. The basis of resisting personal oppression is "no harm and no reciprocating harm" .. "To you your religion, and to me mine" .. "I withdraw from you and I call upon my Lord" .. Among the greatest models of resisting family oppression are the two models of the Friend of the Most Merciful, upon him be prayers and peace, and of our Prophet ﷺ and his family.""")

h(13, 600, """The difference between the concept of resisting oppression and the concept of aggression is immense!""")

h(13, 1800, """I marvel at one who chooses not to pay the cost of inevitable human conflict and says: "Why is my personality weak?!" """)

t(13, 2500, """From among these and those the elite are drawn! Those chosen to be champions of perfection of the soul, not perfection of the body!""")

h(14, 400, """ "Most" people make the decision to live as oppressors, and most of the oppressed make the decision to live as oppressed!""")

t(14, 1130, """Arm muscles are built only by using a sport called (resistance)! And likewise the muscles of the soul are built only by resistance!""")

h(14, 1600, """Immense psychological strength is the muscles of the soul, exactly as a man builds his arm muscles!""")

t(14, 2330, """By the might of Allah Most High I continue answering this recurring question .. How can I be strong in these hard times .. A new answer in the picture. What matters is that all of it be guided and granted success from Allah Most High, for the servant has no might and no power of his own; might and power are from Allah Most High alone""")

h(15, 400, """Immense psychological strength is the product of a fierce daily confrontation with the oppressors, and of a spirit with a will beyond the mind's imagining that never surrenders!""")

t(15, 1000, """Spain's precedents in playing the mediator role with Western consensus and Western backing! Information ((copied)), out of honesty, without alteration; it should contribute to the political culture of whoever follows world politics, influenced by the West at almost every station of history.

Spain has a long historical record of playing the role of strategic mediator, especially in Middle East conflicts, benefiting from its geographic position as a link between Europe and the Arab world. Here are the most prominent stations in which Spain embodied this role:

The Madrid Peace Conference (1991): considered the most important station in the history of Spanish mediation, as Madrid hosted the first direct face-to-face negotiations between Israel and the Arab states (Syria, Lebanon, Jordan) and the Palestinians. This conference later paved the way for the Oslo Accords, and Spain was then considered "neutral ground" acceptable to all parties.

Banning military bases (1973 War): during the October 1973 war, Spain (despite being under Franco at the time) took the stance of "a mediator siding with justice" by refusing to allow the United States to use the military bases on its soil to resupply Israel with weapons, which strengthened the Arab states' trust in it.

The Mediation in the Mediterranean Initiative (2012): Spain, in cooperation with Morocco, launched the "Mediation in the Mediterranean Initiative" to promote a culture of dialogue and prevent regional disputes before they escalate.

The Alliance of Civilizations (2004): after the Madrid train bombings, former Spanish Prime Minister "José Luis Zapatero" launched the "Alliance of Civilizations" initiative at the United Nations to confront extremism through cultural and religious dialogue rather than military clash, which made Madrid a center of preventive diplomacy.

Founding the (KAICIID) Centre: Spain participated in founding the International Centre for Interreligious and Intercultural Dialogue (currently headquartered in Lisbon) in 2012, with the aim of building bridges of communication in conflict areas with religious backgrounds.""")

h(15, 2350, """Spain, the Western bridge. An old, recurring Western strategy, even if the country used changes!""")

t(16, 650, """A comment on Spain's supposed uprising against the West, and how one of the naive ((the model)) thinks when he analyzed the Spanish shift and counted it among the good tidings for the Ummah of Islam?! A model of TikTok building minds that will never reach understanding, because TikTok is no place to build any minds!

It recurs in history that a sudden political shift, contrary to previous behavior, occurs amid an imminent global conflict for various reasons. The strange thing is that one of them believes Spain has become an enemy of Europe and the United States and has become pro-China! Naivety of this size cannot be imagined! Spain is not a village in Europe; its needs tied to its geopolitical surroundings are a historical need that cannot be redirected toward a China thousands of kilometers away. The Spanish know very well how America, Germany and France lie in wait for China. But to hear one of them tell people: Spain is now with China, and his mind works from what the news broadcasts, and he has this level of superficiality, where the news is the main shaper of his brain, not reading history, politics, political logic and the modern historical vision of the world of 1945, this is a problem of awareness that springs from a naive mind to pour into the minds of some of those who listen to him; that is why we hated something called the internet. Spain is playing a role in agreement with the United States, a logistical, psychological and political role that the West will need, and it will not last very long because Spain's weight is not great; rather, it is meant to become a future mediator, political or logistical or both. But how ready this naive model is to believe every piece of news that comes out to him, telling his followers that the proof of Spain's exit from the Western system is that this year, instead of burning an effigy of Judas, it burned an effigy of "the Stinker"! This kind of naivety arises when a person is unable to understand how states are run from inside and outside, and from the absence of reading history, for TikTok culture cannot build a mind.""")

h(16, 1900, """Political repositioning with American consent. It is naive to consider Spain an ally of China!""")

t(16, 2515, """The fool lives his lifetime without seeing, without perceiving, without understanding and without grasping, then his life collapses and he lives in it as a prisoner forever, because the fate of the oppressor is a judge who accepts no appeal""")

h(17, 1500, """Psychological strength is not free! It is smelting, endurance, patience, hammering and letting go""")

h(18, 300, """The world after the summit will not resemble the world before the summit!""")

t(18, 840, """Whenever your chest feels tight, remember Allah Most High ((at once)), for it is the great antidote, swift in effect; its effect comes in the same moment, without delay. Let no cause keep you from it as much as you can! Tightness of the chest is a poison that eats the body and the soul, and the remembrance of Allah the Almighty is mighty in effect.

Our Mighty Lord, holy are His names and attributes, magnified in the heavens and the earth, and exalted greatly, says: "Those who believe and whose hearts find rest in the remembrance of Allah. Verily, in the remembrance of Allah do hearts find rest" """)

h(18, 1500, """The remembrance of Allah is among the greatest things by which the weary heart is strengthened""")

t(18, 2215, """Whoever fabricated slander, lies, falsehood and deceit, and exalted himself above the clear truth, and puffed up his ego above the shining right, this will be his fate! A word, and above it a verse, struck some of them, some of the people of fatteh, trotters and onion bulbs, who call for eating everything .. everything .. People's comments on their silly episodes are part of the threat of humiliation for the aggressor, the deceiver, the slanderer against Allah's creation, and the one who speaks in ignorance, when he is humiliated in this world!""")
